{"id":"cfa29222af6471b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md","title":"L-Hierarchy","display":"df-l-hierarchy — L-Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-l-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-l-hierarchy"],"display":"df-l-hierarchy — L-Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-l-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-l-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-l-hierarchy — L-Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the proper class of ordinals (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(L_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is a class function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is a metatheoretic predicate on class functions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}l\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet) \\leftrightarrow\nL_0=\\emptyset \\land\n\\bigl(\\forall \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\alpha))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall \\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\,(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}l\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet) \\leftrightarrow\nL_0=\\emptyset \\land\n\\bigl(\\forall \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\alpha))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall \\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\,(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-th level of the constructible hierarchy.</li>\n<li>The hierarchy is class-sized; it is not a set function whose domain is the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ is the proper class of ordinals (see [[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Def}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","di